OL,3,AUS says it will issue visa to Flavio
OL,4,ABolsonaro as Brazilian authorities
OL,5,Aquestion his whereabouts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US state department tells the BBC
OL,8,Fit will issue visas to Flavio Bolsonaro
OL,9,Fand his family as Brazilian authorities
OL,10,Fquestion his whereabouts
OL,12,FPolice in Brazil say they cancelled the
OL,13,Fsenator's passports after he failed to
OL,14,Fcomply with a Supreme Court order to
OL,15,Fsurrender the documents
OL,17,FReports from several media outlets
OL,18,Fsuggest that the presidential candidate
OL,19,Fhas travelled to the US
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
